        {
          "id": "f2",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Along Hamilton&#x27;s riverfront, many people take pride in the finer details of home and lifestyle, and a smile deserves the same consideration. Our consultations are unhurried, so you can explain exactly what you would like to change and understand every option before deciding."
        },
        {
          "id": "f3",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "We combine clinical photography, digital scans and careful discussion to plan treatment around your face, bite and long-term oral health. Discover more About Precision Dental and our philosophy of care."
        }
      ]
