        {
          "id": "f3",
          "label": "Question",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Can I see a preview before getting veneers?",
          "group": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "f4",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Where appropriate, Digital Smile Design allows you to visualise proposed changes before treatment. The final result may differ slightly from any preview.",
          "group": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "f5",
          "label": "Question",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Are veneers permanent?",
          "group": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "f6",
          "label": "Paragraph",
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Porcelain veneers usually require a thin layer of enamel to be removed, so the tooth will always need a veneer or another restoration.",
